WEBVTT

00:01.400 --> 00:04.990
-HOLY GOD CALENDAR YEAR 428-
ROGNAS KINGDOM, WALLED CITY NEAR THE BORDER

00:19.320 --> 00:20.240
Watch out!

00:21.650 --> 00:22.440
What was that?!

00:28.570 --> 00:30.030
Looks like waiting for Shadrak

00:28.820 --> 00:31.780
TEARIS RESURRECTIA

00:30.030 --> 00:31.490
and the others isn't an option.

00:32.360 --> 00:35.900
We must put an end to this within the city's walls.

00:32.570 --> 00:35.690
ARAKAEL DEGRADIOS

00:38.900 --> 00:39.820
Hark, Tearis!

00:40.320 --> 00:42.650
I trust you shall restore them after.

00:44.240 --> 00:48.440
In other words, the pain is temporary
and for the greater good?

00:57.030 --> 01:01.490
The townspeople can be revived,
so purge the townspeople and the monsters.

01:01.690 --> 01:03.440
It is the most logical path.

01:21.320 --> 01:22.740
What are you doing?!

01:23.320 --> 01:27.490
LEONIS SHEALTO, 12 YEARS OLD

01:23.860 --> 01:25.780
I can't abide by something as tedious as

01:25.780 --> 01:28.530
murdering an entire town and bringing them back to life.

01:42.570 --> 01:44.240
Thank goodness I found you!

02:08.820 --> 02:09.780
Sir Leonis!

02:09.900 --> 02:10.690
Sir Leonis!

02:10.690 --> 02:11.610
Sir Leonis!

02:12.030 --> 02:13.690
It's the Hero!

02:13.900 --> 02:14.990
Sir Leonis!

02:13.900 --> 02:16.070
Thank you, Mr. Hero!

02:16.400 --> 02:19.860
The Hero of the Holy Sword…

02:20.490 --> 02:22.320
He's a dangerous one.

02:22.990 --> 02:27.900
Someday, he's going to dig his own grave
with that power of his…

04:22.320 --> 04:24.360
UK6402 has been lost.

04:24.940 --> 04:28.400
For something so large to simply vanish…
It's a Void, yes?

04:28.990 --> 04:30.440
It could have crystallized.

04:30.820 --> 04:33.360
We must find and eliminate it
before it can manifest again.

04:34.070 --> 04:34.900
Acting Commander.

04:35.030 --> 04:35.740
What is it?

04:35.990 --> 04:40.610
A Holy Swordswoman from the 18th Platoon would like
to share the results of her investigation with us.

04:40.990 --> 04:44.490
A two-digit designation? So she's a student.

04:44.990 --> 04:47.610
She's exceptionally gifted where research
and data analysis are concerned,

04:47.610 --> 04:49.110
and she's a daughter of the Phillet family.

04:49.440 --> 04:52.940
As in the Phillet Foundation?
What's she doing in the Seventh Assault Garden?

04:54.190 --> 04:59.780
Her father was an invaluable addition to my arms
development advisory coucil. We ought to hear her out.

05:00.490 --> 05:01.860
Go ahead and patch her through.

05:01.860 --> 05:02.570
Yes, sir.

05:07.530 --> 05:08.490
Please begin.

05:09.940 --> 05:10.780
A few minutes ago,

05:10.780 --> 05:15.780
I detected localized micro-vibrations in Block 62 of the
controlled access area beneath the Assault Garden.

05:16.320 --> 05:18.070
Timestamp 12:03.

05:18.440 --> 05:22.150
At approximately the same time and location, I also
detected mana waveforms with very distinctive features.

05:22.610 --> 05:24.820
After amplifying them
and removing any background noise,

05:24.820 --> 05:27.400
I concluded that they do not align
with those of a magical device.

05:28.400 --> 05:33.400
Furthermore, I observed fluctuations in spatial mass
that have led to disruptions in the magnetic field.

05:33.400 --> 05:35.650
This, in turn, has created mobile network outages.

05:36.030 --> 05:41.820
Finally, at 12:14… I observed the exact same
phenomenon two blocks over in Block 59.

05:42.650 --> 05:46.610
Taking these details into account, the data suggests
the presence of Void activity in the Assault Garden-

05:46.610 --> 05:48.150
S-slow down for a second!

05:48.320 --> 05:50.240
How dare you imply such a thing?!

05:50.360 --> 05:52.490
You're saying Voids have infiltrated the underground?!

05:52.490 --> 05:55.440
She's right. They're subtle,
but we are detecting vibrations.

05:55.650 --> 05:58.400
We've received reports of strange noises in Block 59.

05:58.740 --> 06:01.490
They're investigating the source
in maintenance tunnel No. 29 right now.

06:01.900 --> 06:02.690
What?!

06:02.820 --> 06:04.150
And the Void feedback?

06:04.150 --> 06:06.070
Why isn't it registering on the mana scale?!

06:06.740 --> 06:09.280
Because the feedback levels
measure below the scale's threshold.

06:09.530 --> 06:12.650
That being said, the time and location
of the vibrations do match…

06:13.190 --> 06:15.900
Assuming it's 6402, how did it gain entry?!

06:16.740 --> 06:19.690
There are gaps throughout
the float module cluster as part of its design,

06:19.690 --> 06:23.320
like the contact points
or the anchor chain's coiled opening.

06:23.530 --> 06:25.030
It slipped through a crack?!

06:26.570 --> 06:29.570
We're detecting minor damage to a bulkhead in Block 31.

06:29.570 --> 06:31.030
It seems to be on the move again.

06:31.320 --> 06:33.690
But why isn't it using magic?

06:33.690 --> 06:38.400
Perhaps it's intentionally disguising its movements
so that it can sneak farther into the city?

06:38.650 --> 06:40.690
Voids don't possess that level of intelligence!

06:40.900 --> 06:45.610
Did you ever find a crystal
indicating UK6402's disappearance?

06:49.990 --> 06:51.360
Incoming report from the Resources Department:

06:51.610 --> 06:56.150
Thick, root-like vegetation is growing
in underground storeroom No. 226.

06:56.690 --> 06:58.900
G-get somebody out there right now!

06:58.900 --> 06:59.610
Understood!

07:01.320 --> 07:03.150
I can't get a hold of Lady Selia…

07:03.490 --> 07:05.740
What's the name of the facility she's at?

07:06.030 --> 07:09.150
Sunny Spot House. The kid probably went with her…

07:10.570 --> 07:12.820
I'm sending out my Eye of the Witch drones.

07:13.320 --> 07:16.780
Finé… are Voids invading the city?

07:17.240 --> 07:19.280
I just hope there aren't very many of them…

07:20.690 --> 07:23.570
Be ready to move out at a moment's notice, okay?

07:23.570 --> 07:24.400
Got it.

07:27.150 --> 07:28.820
Can't get through…

07:28.820 --> 07:31.900
Where'd ya go, newbie?
Don't just up and abandon your shift…!

07:35.360 --> 07:36.530
Mm-mmm… Tasty!

07:39.820 --> 07:41.610
How's the turnip soup?

07:41.900 --> 07:43.530
Yummy!

07:46.070 --> 07:49.150
It has a mellow flavor… Simple yet savory.

07:49.150 --> 07:52.030
Hey, you! Can I see your Holy Sword?!

07:52.360 --> 07:55.320
This brat… He's got an awful lot of nerve…

07:55.530 --> 07:58.610
Stop it, Dean. You're making him uncomfortable.

07:59.360 --> 08:01.490
Here, feel free to use my handkerchief.

08:01.490 --> 08:03.190
Okay…

08:03.570 --> 08:04.860
Thanks, Tessera.

08:05.280 --> 08:06.400
"Tessera," eh?

08:06.400 --> 08:09.030
At least some children know
how to mind their manners…

08:09.030 --> 08:13.690
Um… I also think it's really cool
you can wield a Holy Sword!

08:21.530 --> 08:26.320
Our reinforcements have identified traces
of UK6402's presence in the maintenance tunnels.

08:26.490 --> 08:27.820
Alpha One to HQ.

08:27.820 --> 08:30.820
We've arrived at storeroom No. 226.
Transmitting the footage.

08:32.280 --> 08:33.940
Should we eliminate it? Please advise.

08:42.530 --> 08:44.240
We're under attack! Returning fire!

08:44.440 --> 08:46.530
Detecting Void feedback in storeroom No. 226!

08:46.690 --> 08:48.240
It knows we've caught on…

08:48.240 --> 08:50.440
But of all places, why underground…?

08:50.610 --> 08:54.280
The city's anti-aircraft defenses may be strong,
but underground security is lacking.

08:54.280 --> 08:57.070
Shouldn't we issue an evacuation alert
as soon as possible?!

08:57.400 --> 08:59.820
I can't reach the commander at the capital…!

08:59.900 --> 09:02.280
Inter-city communications are down
due to network outages.

09:02.400 --> 09:04.990
There's only one target… We can destroy it!

09:05.190 --> 09:09.030
Just in case, I'll call a board meeting
to get the preparations under way.

09:10.740 --> 09:12.360
We've restored the task force's video feed.

09:12.860 --> 09:14.320
Was the target eliminated?

09:14.320 --> 09:17.240
No. It, uh… escaped, sir.

09:17.610 --> 09:18.860
Void feedback subsiding.

09:19.030 --> 09:20.990
What the hell is this thing…?

09:20.990 --> 09:23.150
Void attacks are supposed to be brief and isolated!

09:23.490 --> 09:25.490
Maybe it really is conserving its strength…

09:25.860 --> 09:29.110
Look, these damage alerts run parallel
to the energy supply line…

09:29.190 --> 09:31.320
Wouldn't it be easier to pass through
the maintenance tunnels?

09:31.690 --> 09:34.150
Energy seems to be leaking from the supply line…

09:35.900 --> 09:39.530
The amount lost correlates
with the distance travelled by UK6402!

09:39.610 --> 09:41.690
But the line originates at the power plant!

09:41.780 --> 09:43.240
Wh-what does that mean?!

09:43.490 --> 09:46.570
6402 may be heading for the power plant as we speak!

09:47.740 --> 09:52.990
If 6402 is indeed a Void Lord and it manages
to access the power plant's massive energy reserves,

09:52.990 --> 09:55.150
then couldn't it trigger a Stampede?

09:59.690 --> 10:01.490
Protect the power plant!

10:01.530 --> 10:04.030
We've got a robust intercept system in place down there!

10:04.690 --> 10:06.190
I'm also sending in my men!

10:32.240 --> 10:34.820
Engaging with suspected target, 6402!

10:38.530 --> 10:39.940
Is the intercept system intact?

10:40.440 --> 10:41.440
It's currently active.

10:42.570 --> 10:43.820
Partial loss of functionality!

10:44.400 --> 10:45.820
15% non-operational!

10:45.150 --> 10:47.400
Since we cannot contact the capital,
that puts YOU in charge.

10:45.820 --> 10:47.780
Divert support from above-ground facilities!

10:48.070 --> 10:49.900
As of now, we will regard UK6402 as a Void Lord.

10:58.780 --> 11:02.400
The Seventh Assault Garden will shift into Fortress Mode.

11:02.610 --> 11:10.490
Evacuate civilians to the shelter
and prepare all military personnel for a Stampede!

11:10.650 --> 11:11.440
Roger!

11:11.690 --> 11:13.610
I'll set up my command post in the control room.

11:13.860 --> 11:15.780
You stay here and monitor the operation.

11:15.940 --> 11:16.780
Yes, sir!

11:19.570 --> 11:23.070
C'mon, what's the big deal?! Show us your Holy Sword!

11:23.070 --> 11:24.610
Yeah, show us!

11:24.740 --> 11:29.530
That's enough. A Holy Swordsman's Holy Sword
isn't a toy for our amusement.

11:29.650 --> 11:31.110
Aww…

11:31.440 --> 11:34.610
Lighten up, Leo. Can't you give them just a tiny peek?

11:34.990 --> 11:38.150
Yes, I suppose showing my minion
how little effort it requires

11:38.150 --> 11:41.110
to entertain a group of children isn't a bad idea…

11:41.860 --> 11:45.070
Then I might as well treat them
to an even more spectacular performance.

11:51.900 --> 11:52.690
Eek!

11:52.690 --> 11:53.400
Ew…

12:05.320 --> 12:06.150
Not good!

12:06.150 --> 12:08.190
Hold it! You'll hit the power plant!

12:18.650 --> 12:20.400
B-but this means…

12:28.780 --> 12:30.110
A mode shift?

12:30.490 --> 12:31.490
It can't be…!

12:38.780 --> 12:40.650
Are those all Voids?

12:41.280 --> 12:44.280
A Stampede… here…?

12:51.610 --> 12:55.610
We're witnessing a Stampede, a large-scale influx
of Voids acting under a leader's command.

13:18.320 --> 13:20.400
Launching high-altitude emergency signal.

13:28.610 --> 13:31.240
Disconnecting power plant-derived energy supply.

13:32.030 --> 13:35.610
Our combat capabilities won't be impacted,
as each block has its own magical reserves.

13:36.030 --> 13:41.190
It will take three days for assistance to arrive
from the capital, at minimum. Can we hold out that long?

13:42.110 --> 13:43.490
No matter the cost, sir.

13:45.530 --> 13:50.570
We've trained the Holy Swordsmen at our academy well.
They're not so weak as to admit defeat after three days.

13:51.530 --> 13:53.240
If anyone can do it, it's them.

14:01.190 --> 14:02.570
What about Lady Selia?

14:02.900 --> 14:06.570
We're expected to defend our assigned
district in the event of an emergency,

14:06.570 --> 14:07.820
so she should be on her way here.

14:07.820 --> 14:09.070
Please remain calm and form a line!

14:09.650 --> 14:11.990
For now, let's focus on the enemies in front of us.

14:14.900 --> 14:17.360
All platoons are hereby permitted to fire at will.

14:43.650 --> 14:47.030
Activate! Holy Sword Raikirimaru!

14:52.610 --> 14:54.190
Drag Blast!

14:58.070 --> 15:00.740
Now, let's give it a shot!

15:05.190 --> 15:08.440
The offensive capabilities of their weaponry
are impressive, too…

15:10.530 --> 15:12.570
I can't get in touch with the academy…

15:13.190 --> 15:15.320
We have to get everyone to the shelter!

15:15.900 --> 15:16.990
Milord.

15:21.030 --> 15:23.610
The city is being inundated
with strange-looking monsters.

15:23.740 --> 15:25.990
How do you wish to proceed? I await your orders.

15:26.280 --> 15:28.400
Oh! Perfect timing, Shary.

15:29.150 --> 15:31.570
A little TOO perfect, don't you think?

15:31.780 --> 15:37.990
Getting curious and tailing a Demon Lord and his newest
minion across town… is something I would NEVER do.

15:37.990 --> 15:40.650
You're a sneaky one, aren't you?
Following me around like that…

15:40.650 --> 15:42.070
Nope, just got lucky.

15:42.360 --> 15:46.150
Alright then… Your mission
is to protect my minion's friends.

15:47.820 --> 15:50.610
But I'd much rather protect YOU, milord…

15:50.900 --> 15:52.280
Quit complaining and go!

15:52.490 --> 15:53.740
As you wish.

15:55.030 --> 15:56.320
Leo, c'mere!

15:59.860 --> 16:03.490
We'll go to the shelter together,
so let's move quickly and quietly.

16:05.110 --> 16:06.860
It's too dangerous to go outside right now!

16:07.150 --> 16:07.860
What?!

16:15.690 --> 16:17.070
Everyone stay put!

16:17.860 --> 16:18.740
'Kay…

16:24.400 --> 16:25.900
Holy Sword, activate!

16:30.320 --> 16:34.900
My minion has yet to awaken
to her true potential as a Vampire Queen…

16:35.490 --> 16:37.900
Miss Selia, aren't you frightened?

16:38.440 --> 16:39.440
Of course I am.

16:39.740 --> 16:42.900
But… I can't run away at a time like this!

16:44.690 --> 16:50.440
She shows a lot of promise… but I'd be remiss
if I let these creatures ruin such an excellent minion.

17:05.990 --> 17:06.780
Huh?!

17:13.900 --> 17:16.320
Those flames… You did that, Leo?

17:16.940 --> 17:18.780
Up there! More Voids incoming!

17:30.740 --> 17:34.490
Oh-ho… Now THAT certainly brings back memories.

17:44.490 --> 17:45.860
We've got three ogre-class Voids!

17:46.190 --> 17:47.320
I'll slice my way through!

17:47.860 --> 17:48.650
Sakuya-!

17:49.490 --> 17:51.740
Pierce all in thy path, Blade of Lightning…

17:52.570 --> 17:53.780
Raikirimaru!

18:11.400 --> 18:14.030
We've cleared out all Voids within a 300-merte radius.

18:27.690 --> 18:29.860
No way… A hydra-class?!

18:30.900 --> 18:33.190
Th-that one might be a bit trickier…

18:56.440 --> 18:59.780
So even the mighty dragon race
has been reduced to mere Voids…

19:00.280 --> 19:04.440
If that creature is equipped with
the same level of magic resistance as a dragon,

19:04.440 --> 19:06.530
an ordinary spell isn't enough to kill it.

19:07.940 --> 19:12.900
Miss Selia, I'm going to cast powerful sorcery.
I need you to protect me for a minute.

19:12.990 --> 19:13.530
I'm on it!

19:16.280 --> 19:16.900
Take that!

19:17.400 --> 19:18.860
O, heavenly stars…

19:19.030 --> 19:21.650
Thou who bestows thy judgment upon the insolent…

19:23.490 --> 19:25.320
What in the world am I doing?

19:25.650 --> 19:28.440
It makes no difference to me
whether a human city falls or not.

19:28.900 --> 19:29.740
And yet…

19:30.240 --> 19:34.820
I cannot turn a blind eye to those who would dare
pick a fight with a Demon Lord and his minion.

19:35.990 --> 19:38.070
Level 10 spell of widespread destruction!

19:38.990 --> 19:40.240
Zemexis Jyura!

19:51.530 --> 19:52.740
W-watch it, Leo!

19:52.740 --> 19:56.530
Please just stay still!
As long as you don't move, I won't hit you!

20:03.400 --> 20:04.610
Get out of there, Miss Selia!

20:09.150 --> 20:12.070
This human form reduces my ability to chant quickly!

20:15.320 --> 20:15.990
Blackus!

20:16.860 --> 20:20.650
O, dark star… Fall from the heavens before my majesty!

20:21.150 --> 20:24.610
Level 10 sorcery, Gran Mezekis!

20:38.400 --> 20:40.940
He defeated a mega-colossal Void…?!

21:05.610 --> 21:06.530
Miss Selia!

21:19.820 --> 21:20.740
What the…?!

21:21.320 --> 21:27.320
Le…o…nis…

21:28.030 --> 21:30.240
Oh, it's you…

21:31.190 --> 21:33.240
Arakael Degradios!

23:07.320 --> 23:08.440
What's this button?

23:08.440 --> 23:12.860
I found it during my investigation. Supposedly,
when you press it, the city undergoes a transformation.

23:13.400 --> 23:15.110
Interesting… Here goes.

23:15.110 --> 23:17.110
Stop! The entire city will change!

23:17.280 --> 23:18.400
It's no laughing matter!

23:19.940 --> 23:20.900
STOP!

23:27.900 --> 23:28.740
Don't play with it.

23:28.740 --> 23:31.440
But this is a comedy segment…

23:31.820 --> 23:32.780
I guess you're right…

23:46.030 --> 23:50.150
THE DEMON LORD'S RESOLVE
